      "id": "r1",
      "name": "S****",
      "date": "March 26, 2025",
      "title": "We are back for Pandi",
      "text": "You all have helped us and several small seniors we've rescued over the years. Now it's Pandi's time for your great product! They hold up so well, too. She's just a little bigger than our others.",
      "stars": 5,
      "image": "/images/premium-puppy-diapers/small-dog-indoor-review.jpg.jpeg",
      "helpful": 0,
      "notHelpful": 1,
      "verified": true,
      "withImages": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "name": "S****** L******",
      "date": "March 26, 2024",
      "title": "Our Sweetie Wheatie",
      "text": "This is truly a life changing product for both our dog and ourselves. After adopting our dog at 8 weeks old, we later learned after many issues with potty training that she had a ectopic ureter causing her to leak urine. After many procedures, she still wasn't able to fully hold her urine which made caring for her very difficult. We found PeeKeeper after searching desperately for something that would help her. She's almost 8 years old now, and she's owned MANY of these over the years. They've truly become integrated into our daily routine. Thank you for such an amazing product! We will continue to buy them and recommend them!",
      "stars": 5,
      "image": "/images/premium-puppy-diapers/blue-diaper-small-dog-resting-review.jpg.jpeg",
      "helpful": 1,
      "notHelpful": 1,
      "verified": true,
      "withImages": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "name": "C******",
      "date": "October 25, 2023",
      "title": "Old Male Mini Daxie",
      "text": "This is an AMAZING PRODUCT. 5 years of daily use so far. My 14 year old mini doxie has been bad in the house for years. But, I love him and that means he stays. He wears this from morning to night with about 5 pad changes a day. He cannot get out of it and it does not leak with those big granny pads. I have 2 so when one is the the wash, he wears the other. Kind of gross to admit, but he can do a poo with it on and it does not get stuck inside. Easy to pick up with a tissue and toss. Truly a great thing. He has worn it every day for at least 5 years. Well worth the money and less wear on your carpets.",
      "stars": 5,
      "image": "/images/premium-puppy-diapers/pink-diaper-hallway-review.jpg.jpg",
      "helpful": 9,
      "notHelpful": 1,
      "verified": true,
      "withImages": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "name": "E***",
      "date": "September 8, 2023",
      "title": "",
      "text": "The Medium 16\" PeeKeeper fits perfectly on our Winston! I've attached a picture of it on him. We inserted a long Poise pad which also fits perfectly across to each side. We couldn't be happier. Over the years I've spent a lot of money from different vendors and yours by far are the best. We can't thank you enough. God Bless You and your company for going the extra mile. With sincere gratitude",
      "stars": 5,
      "image": "/images/premium-puppy-diapers/pug-stairs-review.jpg.jpg",
      "helpful": 7,
      "notHelpful": 1,
      "verified": true,
      "withImages": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "name": "M***",
      "date": "July 27, 2023",
      "title": "Jamlot11@yahoo.com",
      "text": "Sadly I'm back to buy my third one Our little guy is getting old and he can't hold his pee...the pee keeper is the only dog diaper I'll ever buy.3 times My First diaper lasted five years. The Red velvet and then denim were my fav.I'm buying another one because this dog is bigger than my last.",
