    },
    {
      "id": "r6",
      "name": "E*****",
      "date": "April 18, 2023",
      "title": "I LOVE your Pee Keepers!",
      "text": "They made my life worth living because one of my other Jack Russell Terriers had CUSHINGS - and I was cleaning up pee-pee all over the place 24/7!!!! I bought 2 of them (one to wear & one in the wash) for him to wear and il having them was LIFE TRANSFORMING for the both of us! He wasn't embarrassed about his little puddles & I wasn't pissed that he went on the ORIENTAL RUG, AGAIN! Now I've rescued a female \"breeding bitch\" from a raid on a back yard breeder/puppy mill. The female I have lived 6 entire years in a cage - and we've been having to socialize and potty train her. (\"Sigh\") .. now, I'm moving from a house with easy clean marble floors to a house with all original real wood floors! So.. your Pee Keepers will once again be indispensable to me!! Thank you so much for having such a life changing product! Eloise",
      "stars": 5,
      "helpful": 8,
      "notHelpful": 1,
      "verified": true
    },
    {
      "id": "r7",
      "name": "A**** W*****",
      "date": "April 7, 2023",
      "title": "Happy Customer",
      "text": "I had heard about this product from my cousin who also has a Yorkie. My precious Rex was marking everything and I had tried the wrap around diapers. He would get under things to wedge himself out of them. I even sewed a strap on it to tie it to his collar. He would still manage to get it off and run around with the diaper dangling beside him. He is one smart cookie. Lol! Thank you so much for your help and such a wonderful product. It has helped keep me less stressed watching his every move.",
      "reply": "We are so happy to hear what a life changer the PeeKeeper has been for you and Rex. Thanks for sharing it with us. We love hearing from our customers.",
